{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "cab62db6-3b4e-87b8-8fe5-38690a8b6406",
  "created_at": "2026-02-19T09:13:39-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Julio Pagan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:09:00-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you this morning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:09:06-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, good morning. My name is Julio Pagan. I'm calling about my mother, really. She's the one at the house, but she doesn't do the phone much anymore, so I'm calling for her."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:09:19-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right, Mr. Pagan. Take your time. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:09:24-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's a noise. The restaurant next door to her has got some kind of heating and air unit, the big fan thing, and it is loud. It runs all day and half the night. It's been going since the weekend. Saturday, I'd say. Saturday afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:09:41-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Since Saturday. And that's a restaurant right next to your mother's home?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:09:47-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right next door. Where the old hardware place used to be. Well, no, that's not it. The hardware place was on the corner, this is where the, uh, the dry cleaner was. Anyway, it's the restaurant now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:10:01-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. The restaurant next door. And what's the address there, so I have the right location?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:10:08-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three-oh-eight Rhode Island Avenue. That's my mother's house. The restaurant's the one next to it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:10:14-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three-oh-eight Rhode Island Avenue. Let me write that down. Three, zero, eight. Is that up in the Historic Hill area?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:10:22-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, the Hill. That's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:10:25-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And you said it's a loud unit. Can you describe the sound for me? Is it a hum, a rattle, something like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:10:35-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's a drone. A low hum, and then every so often it kicks up and rattles. She can hear it in the bedroom with the window shut. She's not sleeping. I'm not going to pretend I'm thrilled about it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:10:50-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I understand. That would wear on anybody. Does it run constantly, or does it cycle on and off?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:10:58-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Cycles, but it's on more than it's off. Overnight too. I was over there Tuesday night and it was going at, what, eleven o'clock. Past midnight, even."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:11:09-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Have you or your mother spoken with the restaurant about it at all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:11:15-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I stopped in Monday. Talked to a young fella, said he'd tell the owner. Nothing's changed. So now I'm calling you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:11:24-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. So what you'd like is for me to take a report on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:11:30-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. A report. Whatever you do with it. I just want somebody to look at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:11:37-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. I'll get that logged. Let me get a few details first. I have your name as Julio Pagan, and you're calling for your mother. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:11:48-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Correct. Pagan, P-A-G-A-N."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:11:50-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. And is there a good callback number for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:11:55-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-nine-three. That's the one I'm on now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:11:59-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-nine-three. Great. And do you know the name of the restaurant?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:12:05-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I should, shouldn't I. I grew up on the island, been here my whole life, and I hardly ever leave it, but I can't keep track of what these places are called anymore. They change names every couple years. Hold on. [pause] It's got a blue awning. Something Kitchen. I'd have to walk over and look."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:12:26-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's all right. The address will do. I'll note it as the restaurant next to 308 Rhode Island Avenue, with a blue awning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:12:35-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. That'll find it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:12:38-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Now, I'm going to put this in as a noise complaint, a mechanical unit running day and night since Saturday. I'll pass it along to the right office so they can follow up. I can't tell you exactly how soon someone will get out there, but it will be on record as of today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:12:59-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And they'll call me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:13:01-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "They should reach out to the number you gave me. If you don't hear anything in a few days, call back here and we can check where it stands."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:13:12-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. A few days. Fine. I just hope it's not weeks, because she's, you know, she's not young."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:13:19-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. It's logged, and I've noted that it runs overnight, since that's the part that matters most."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:13:27-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Thank you. That's all I needed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:13:31-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Pagan. Have a good day, and tell your mother we're on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:13:37-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Bye now."
    }
  ],
